# The acceptance command for this project.
#
# One command, run from the project root. The Stop hook runs it through
# scripts/verify.mjs and blocks completion until it exits 0.
#
# Replace the example below with the command that decides whether the work is
# done. Shell separators, pipes, redirection, command substitution and `$` are
# refused by the gate. Use one command, or an `&&` chain of allowlisted command
# words.
#
# Lines beginning with # are ignored. Exactly one command is expected.
npm test
